INSERT INTO posts (title, slug, content, excerpt, image_url, image_alt, categories, tags, author, wp_id, published, created_at, updated_at, published_at)
VALUES ('€30,000 grants scheme open for Water Heritage Day', 'e30000-grants-scheme-open-for-water-heritage-day', '<p><span>LAWPRO is a national shared service working on behalf of the 31 local authorities in Ireland coordinating efforts to achieve good water quality across the country.</span></p>
<p><span>Anthony Coleman, director of services at LAWPRO said: &#8220;We are delighted to once again invite community groups to organise a water-related event for Heritage Week. The theme of Heritage Week 2024 is ‘Connections, Routes &amp; Network’, and our rivers play a big part in the connectivity of our island. In historic times they were networks for movement, trading and exploration.</span></p>
<p><span>“Water Heritage Day gives communities a fantastic opportunity to celebrate our heritage through water, whether it be hosting a river safari, a talk at the riverside, or launching a booklet on a local waterway. there are ample ways to get involved.&#8221;</span></p>
<p><span>Organisations are asked to consult with their local community water officer in advance of making an application. Their contact details are here: </span><a href="http://email.mediahq.com/ls/click?upn=u001.tUscXYxxMfH-2B253Hl-2BnKQT9I-2BNyxyMIwfpHIbMVEM8k3EuuBNuQAsSapRThkLiUj8x5-2FLxIAK2NgC9IDCm67OQ-3D-3Dd7m6_pIbxPfpDI69aAybPrpOfg-2FigzpJFraDtuxIuzmSI6fPCpf9nlTK8I0gkXF8RryfaYZJI04I5C5Xd8aK067ayB96erhZ3Ox8xubI5XpD04vKKvOpGjC-2Bd1xnkc2rqhYJZpjhLrIns3FhQR3g2DG-2FSLIw99F7B4I3nK58-2BEB6VXUZ5oi2spOkwUr3ElXIN65yKhHsDnPE1iuIQl-2B9KdlPMGEwrO4OfluE9TZnZmnCsuMgvCGPhYQN3S4-2BRZkrBuEiWDBdBxECTt3QFzIY9wgz5Wg-3D-3D"><span>Communities Team &#8211; Local Authority Water Programme (lawaters.ie)</span></a><span>. The deadline for making an application is Tuesday, July 16.</span></p>
<p><span>Virginia Teehan, CEO of the Heritage Council commented: &#8220;Water Heritage Day continues to be a significant highlight during National Heritage Week every year, showcasing the creative and ingenious ways communities celebrate the impact of canals, lakes, rivers, and the sea on our local heritage. </span></p>
<p><span>“This year, particularly given the theme of &#8216;Connections, Routes, and Networks&#8217;, I am excited to see what kinds of events we see for Water Heritage Day. This LAWPRO grant scheme will enable people to explore and highlight our water-based connections, emphasising how vital they are to our natural heritage. It&#8217;s a wonderful opportunity for event organisers to avail of supports that will encourage them to dive into our shared history and appreciate the incredible resource our waters provide.&#8221;</span></p>
<p><span>To make an application see: </span><a href="http://email.mediahq.com/ls/click?upn=u001.g6RjjPPKnKsEo6ejfewaCW7ZhjejEMuITIX5rXh-2FEJMjQ4upR-2BhamfcunTEKgq6O-2F9eTkaffIdxIEKrDnY0uWnrFpZXRff26BZfl1TtXGXyjr7kxa3hYt3zrJrnGgTs9DW1a4gygoBcMR8HR5Go-2Fdg-3D-3DjIfP_pIbxPfpDI69aAybPrpOfg-2FigzpJFraDtuxIuzmSI6fPCpf9nlTK8I0gkXF8RryfaYZJI04I5C5Xd8aK067ayB96erhZ3Ox8xubI5XpD04vKKvOpGjC-2Bd1xnkc2rqhYJZ-2FouXRo6L3es95lFuKa031HXtTQ5BwN-2FmuhDFUknpT0OYe9Bya0G2SRCfegCEOYHvhiKobVsH44UMWFebSmsXgAe5TRZav5mxEF-2BoqDpRptXD3hCYaMKyikEBsmK5OF4rXQiJ6TMPpnxg72EyLPSskg-3D-3D"><span>LAWPRO Small Grants and Events Scheme 2024 | Online Consultation Portal of the Waters and Communities Office</span></a></p>
<p><span>LAWPRO works in partnership with the Heritage Council, and to run a Heritage Week event organisations are encouraged to register events on their website here: </span><a href="http://email.mediahq.com/ls/click?upn=u001.qe6wUstL7ZbWa5JSD3PjacvqHYecm3pTR1cnNkk96iufaPCDHo9-2FFFZdn9e2t7hfjvdv3P-2F0Um8BL6iSX53J9K36m6iP0b-2FjI07RtiFRc2M-3DklEb_pIbxPfpDI69aAybPrpOfg-2FigzpJFraDtuxIuzmSI6fPCpf9nlTK8I0gkXF8RryfaYZJI04I5C5Xd8aK067ayB96erhZ3Ox8xubI5XpD04vKKvOpGjC-2Bd1xnkc2rqhYJZEalFgoWvi-2BCJZtIe0mcNnQ1jM-2BBDjAE8I6yWVugyU7-2Fr3f3hbP8hepkpDAHuUdK1uz0HuE-2FIr5DoQBkI4TU7yfdUsbNhQT2svZ-2BH2rtrJY33QgoOZAzzi9HttabQE2cKMJ2edXnk0MrAksR7ufKTGg-3D-3D"><span>www.heritageweek.ie/get-involved/organise-an-event</span></a><span> </span></p>
<p><span>By submitting an event on the Heritage Week website and receiving a LAWPRO grant, groups could also be in with a chance to win a Water Heritage Award in 2024, for more information on the awards visit: </span><a href="http://email.mediahq.com/ls/click?upn=u001.1BqJrd0hJGh3gSMs-2B6-2FLQxkcmezlj0vnXq104gKCkKJvqEse2-2BAi7p4aSTXpOP2wqe8lMKbPqIvkyq6-2FcApw5w-3D-3Db87D_pIbxPfpDI69aAybPrpOfg-2FigzpJFraDtuxIuzmSI6fPCpf9nlTK8I0gkXF8RryfaYZJI04I5C5Xd8aK067ayB96erhZ3Ox8xubI5XpD04vKKvOpGjC-2Bd1xnkc2rqhYJZtbhqoW52MdBGggdcb-2BuhzESGAaHgRxpRJi8KDr3oWbq0M-2F3KWl7fzRNp6hn0MmUR7Y69ezoueYZC6MPeDyHoZZ64IMAFj3mXfI-2FvqZXgj23s-2BAdhXodUZiibae9nP3hgaDNvyjOcDelg-2Bc5JYReN3g-3D-3D"><span>National Heritage Week Awards | National Heritage Week 17th – 25th August 2024</span></a></p>', 'The Local Authority Waters Programme (LAWPRO) is encouraging community groups to apply under the ‘Water Heritage Day Grants Scheme 2024’ to celebrate Water Heritage Day on August 25.', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Water-Heritage-Day-Promo-pic.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"grants-subsidies","title":"Grants & Subsidies"}]', '[{"slug":"community-water-officer","title":"community water officer"},{"slug":"environment","title":"Environment"},{"slug":"grant","title":"grant"},{"slug":"heritage-council","title":"Heritage Council"},{"slug":"lawpro","title":"LAWPRO"},{"slug":"local-authorities","title":"local authorities"},{"slug":"local-authority-waters-programme","title":"Local Authority Waters Programme"},{"slug":"national-heritage-week","title":"National Heritage Week"},{"slug":"water-heritage-day","title":"Water Heritage Day"},{"slug":"water-quality","title":"water quality"}]', '', 254274, 1, '2024-07-10T12:37:32Z', '2024-07-10T12:37:32Z', '2024-07-10T12:37:32Z')
